---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import featuresData from '../data/features.json';
const features = featuresData.features;
---

<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header fade-in">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">選ばれる理由</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">安全性・洗浄力・素材への優しさを、同時に</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        引火性のない水系処方でありながら、重質油汚れにも対応する洗浄力を備えています。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      {features.map((feature) => (
        <div class="feature-card fade-in">
          <span class="feature-icon"><Icon name={feature.icon} /></span>
          <h3 class="feature-title">{feature.title}</h3>
          {feature.stat && <p class="feature-stat">{feature.stat}</p>}
          <p class="feature-desc">{feature.description}</p>
          {feature.note && <p class="note feature-note">{feature.note}</p>}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="note grid-note">
      ※記載の性能値はメーカー提供資料および自社試験に基づく参考値です。実際の性能は汚れの種類・素材・温度・希釈率などの条件により異なります。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem 2.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-soft);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-icon :global(svg) {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .feature-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .feature-stat {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-sub);
  }

  .feature-note {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .grid-note {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
